  "sourceText": "Cowboy Dinner\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nSliced potatoes\nSliced onions\nKidney beans with juice\n1 can tomato soup\nBacon strips\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place layer of potatoes, onion and beans in baking dish. Add soup. Top with bacon strips. Bake at 350 degrees for 1 hour or until potatoes are done. Serves 6.",
